n the Indian AC market, is also a prominent brand in East Uttar Pradesh, West Uttar Pradesh, and Uttarakhand. With this new addition, Voltas now boasts a total of 29th brand stores in Eastern Uttar Pradesh and 57th across the UP and Uttarakhand region.</p><h6 class="card-overtitle">April 2025, Mumbai</h6><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Voltas_opens_new_brand_store_in_Kasia_17042025.pdf" class="press-download"><i class="fa fa-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="">download pdf</span></a></div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 all "><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-press_release"><div class="card-body"><h4 class="card-title"><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Voltas_opens_new_brand_stores_in_5_cities.pdf" target="_blank">Voltas Opened Five New Offline Stores In a week Expands its footprint further by opening five new brand stores across Maharashtra, Gujarat, West Bengal and Andhra Pradesh</a></h4><p class="card-text">Voltas Limited, India’s No. 1 AC company, from the house of Tata’s launched five new and exclusive brand stores across Maharashtra, Gujarat, West Bengal and Andhra Pradesh, last week. These state-of-the-art brand stores represent Voltas’ commitment to provide better customer experience. Voltas continues to be a market leader both in Split and Window Air-conditioners in India and these new stores will help Voltas bolster its omnichannel presence while expanding the Company’s reach across the length and breadth of the country.</p><h6 class="card-overtitle">March 2025, Mumbai</h6><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Voltas_opens_new_brand_stores_in_5_cities.pdf" class="press-download"><i class="fa fa-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="">download pdf</span></a></div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 all "><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-press_release"><div class="card-body"><h4 class="card-title"><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/AAHAR_2025_Press_Release.pdf" target="_blank">Voltas Limited to showcase its extensive portfolio of energy-efficient Commercial Refrigeration products at AAHAR 2025</a></h4><p class="card-text">Voltas Limited, India’s No. 1 AC & Commercial Refrigeration company, from the house of Tata’s, announced its participation in the 39th edition of AAHAR. AAHAR is an international food and hospitality fair powered by India Trade Promotion Organisation (ITPO) at Bharat Mandapam, Delhi. Voltas will be showcasing its cutting-edge, energy-efficient Commercial Refrigeration products at AAHAR 2025.</p><h6 class="card-overtitle">March 2025, Mumbai</h6><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/AAHAR_2025_Press_Release.pdf" class="press-download"><i class="fa fa-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="">download pdf</span></a></div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 all "><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-press_release"><div class="card-body"><h4 class="card-title"><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Voltas_opens_new_brand_store_in_Faridabad.pdf" target="_blank">Voltas opens new brand store in Faridabad Expands its footprint further by opening a new brand store in Haryana</a></h4><p class="card-text">Voltas Limited, India’s No. 1 AC company, from the house of Tata’s has launched new and exclusive brand stores in Faridabad, today. Voltas, which holds the top position in the Indian AC market, is also a prominent brand in Haryana and Delhi NCR. With this new addition, Voltas now boasts a total of 20 brand stores in Haryana and 38 across the Delhi and Haryana belt.</p><h6 class="card-overtitle">March 2025, Mumbai</h6><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Voltas_opens_new_brand_store_in_Faridabad.pdf" class="press-download"><i class="fa fa-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="">download pdf</span></a></div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 all "><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-press_release"><div class="card-body"><h4 class="card-title"><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Voltas_opens_new_brand_store_in_Shahjahanpur.pdf" target="_blank">Voltas opens new brand stores in Shahjahanpur Expands its footprint further by opening new brand stores in Uttar Pradesh</a></h4><p class="card-text">Voltas Limited, India’s No. 1 AC company, from the house of Tata’s has launched new and exclusive brand stores in Shahjahanpur, today. Voltas, which holds the top position in the Indian AC market, is also a prominent brand in East Uttar Pradesh, West Uttar Pradesh, and Uttarakhand. With these new additions, Voltas now boasts a total of 29 brand stores in Eastern Uttar Pradesh and 54 across the UP and Uttarakhand region.</p><h6 class="card-overtitle">February 2025, Mumbai</h6><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Voltas_opens_new_brand_store_in_Shahjahanpur.pdf" class="press-download"><i class="fa fa-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="">download pdf</span></a></div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 all "><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-press_release"><div class="card-body"><h4 class="card-title"><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Voltas_Acrex_Exhibition_Press_Release-revised.pdf" target="_blank">Voltas Limited to showcase its innovative range of smart and energy efficient HVAC products and solutions in ACREX 2025</a></h4><p class="card-text">Voltas Limited, India’s Premier AC company, from the house of Tata’s is all set to participate in one of South Asia’s biggest HVAC exhibition, ACREX India 2025. Recognized for its excellence in room air-conditioning, commercial air-conditioning solutions and commercial refrigeration, Voltas is all set to showcase its cutting-edge, energy-efficient green products and comprehensive life cycle management services.</p><h6 class="card-overtitle">February 2025, Mumbai</h6><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Voltas_Acrex_Exhibition_Press_Release-revised.pdf" class="press-download"><i class="fa fa-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="">download pdf</span></a></div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 all new-launch"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-press_release"><div class="card-body"><h4 class="card-title"><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Press_release-Voltas_Beko_launches_mixer_grinder_and_dry_iron.pdf" target="_blank">Voltas beko expands product portfolio with the launch of Mixer Grinder and Dry Iron on Flipkart</a></h4><p class="card-text">Voltas Beko, a leading name in home appliances category, is excited to announce the launch of its two latest innovations in the Small Domestic Appliances (SDA) category,
the Mixer Grinder and Dry Iron, is now available exclusively on Flipkart. Designed with cutting-edge technology and customer convenience in mind, the new products promise to elevate the home experience for modern consumers.</p><h6 class="card-overtitle">February 2025, Mumbai</h6><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Press_release-Voltas_Beko_launches_mixer_grinder_and_dry_iron.pdf" class="press-download"><i class="fa fa-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="">download pdf</span></a></div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 all financial"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-press_release"><div class="card-body"><h4 class="card-title"><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/KeyHighlightsofVoltasConsolidatedFinancialResultsQ3FY25andLeadershipTransitionAnnouncement.pdf" target="_blank"> Key Highlights of Voltas’ Consolidated Financial Results Q3 FY25 and Leadership Transition Announcement</a></h4><p class="card-text">The Board of Directors of Valtas Limited, the global air conditioning and engineering services provider of the Tata Group, announced the Consolidated Financial Results (including the Consolidated Segment Report) of the Company for the quarter and nine months ended 31st December, 2024.</p><h6 class="card-overtitle">January 2025, Mumbai</h6><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/KeyHighlightsofVoltasConsolidatedFinancialResultsQ3FY25andLeadershipTransitionAnnouncement.pdf" class="press-download"><i class="fa fa-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="">download pdf</span></a></div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 all "><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-press_release"><div class="card-body"><h4 class="card-title"><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Press_release-Voltas_Beko_Teams_Up_with_Influencers_to_Boost_Awareness_of_HarvestFresh_Technology_in_Refrigerators.pdf" target="_blank">Voltas Beko collaborates with influencers to elevate awareness and strengthen affinity for their innovative HarvestFresh Technology in refrigerators</a></h4><p class="card-text">Voltas Beko, a leading brand in the consumer appliances space, is excited to announce the launch of its new influencer campaign to promote its revolutionary HarvestFresh
technology in refrigerators. Following the success of its TV and digital campaigns launched in October last year, this new influencer campaign aims to reach a wider audience by leveraging the power of 20 influencers across various genres, including lifestyle, nutrition, food, and parenting.</p><h6 class="card-overtitle">January 2025, Mumbai</h6><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Press_release-Voltas_Beko_Teams_Up_with_Influencers_to_Boost_Awareness_of_HarvestFresh_Technology_in_Refrigerators.pdf" class="press-download"><i class="fa fa-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="">download pdf</span></a></div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 all "><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-press_release"><div class="card-body"><h4 class="card-title"><a href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/Voltas_Showcased_its_latest_range_of_Commercial_Air_Conditioning_and_Commercial_Refrigeration_Products_at_ABID_Interiors_2025.pdf" target="_blank">Voltas Showcased its latest range of Commercial Air Conditioning and Commercial Refrigeration Products at ABID Interiors 2025</a></h4><p class="card-text">Voltas, India’s undisputed leader in Cooling Products and India’s No.1 AC brand, from the house of TATA, participated in the recent edition of ABID Interiors 2025.
